# ===========================================================================
# POLICY — never rename or delete a published URL without shipping a 301 to its
# successor in the SAME deploy. Paid ads, Google Business Profile, and backlinks
# point at these URLs; a silent rename 404s them within hours and burns ad spend
# (Google disapproves assets on "Destination not working, HTTP 404"). Put the
# redirect in this file in the same commit that renames or removes the page.
#
# www -> apex is handled by a Cloudflare Redirect Rule (zone level), NOT here:
# _redirects matches path only, so a catch-all would also loop on the apex domain.
# ===========================================================================
